From 143222509269fb3c36bc39ffe5f180939944563d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Zhao <yi.zhao@windriver.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Mar 2026 11:32:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] userdomain: allow grant fowner capability to security admin

Commit 62df06[1] removed fowner capability from
userdom_unpriv_user_template(). However, changing SELinux security
category of files requires this capability. Therefore, Add it to
userdom_admin_user_template() to allow the security administrator role
to grant this capability.

Fixes:
$ newrole -r secadm_r -p -- -c "chcat -- +Finance FinanceRecords.txt"
chcon: failed to change context of 'FinanceRecords.txt' to 'mcs_u:object_r:user_home_t:s0:c0': Operation not permitted

avc:  denied  { fowner } for  pid=1324 comm="chcon" capability=3
scontext=root:secadm_r:secadm_t:s0-s15:c0.c1023
tcontext=root:secadm_r:secadm_t:s0-s15:c0.c1023 tclass=capability
permissive=0

[1] https://github.com/SELinuxProject/refpolicy/commit/62df0656afdc0efc62c4552a585fd5030f885af7

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [wrlinux specific]

Signed-off-by: Yi Zhao <yi.zhao@windriver.com>
---
 policy/modules/system/userdomain.if | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/policy/modules/system/userdomain.if b/policy/modules/system/userdomain.if
index c7b6e0e5e..bf39b6f5c 100644
--- a/policy/modules/system/userdomain.if
+++ b/policy/modules/system/userdomain.if
@@ -1512,7 +1512,7 @@ template(`userdom_admin_user_template',`
 ## </param>
 #
 interface(`userdom_security_admin_template',`
-	allow $1 self:capability { dac_override dac_read_search };
+	allow $1 self:capability { dac_override dac_read_search fowner};
 	allow $1 self:capability2 mac_admin;
 
 	corecmd_exec_shell($1)
-- 
2.34.1

